      "desc:8": "A heavier sidearm with six chambers and a bit more punch per shot than the pistol, at the cost of a longer reload. The Revolver uses loose 9mm bullets instead of a magazine: one bullet reloads all six chambers.\n\nIt is built in the LV Assembler from an Iron Barrel, Mechanical Parts, a Wooden Stock, steel plates and screws, and a spring. Compare its damage and range with the pistol on the tooltips and keep the one you like; two Revolvers combine into Akimbo Revolvers at MV.\n\n[note]The Revolver is the cheapest gun to keep fed, because one loose bullet fills it.[/note]",
